                "body": "<div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-2\"> col-2 </div>  <div class=\"col-4\">  <p>Please listen to the following col-4</p>{{i5f20483a2fe9c}}</div>  <div class=\"col-2\"> col-2 </div>  <div class=\"col-2\"> col-2 </div>  <div class=\"col-2\"> col-2 <p> In what year did man land on the moon? </p> {{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e5e7a7132dd8915047479}} </div>    </div>        <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-5\"> col-5 </div>  <div class=\"col-2\"> col-2 <br> {{img_5f4f84bf770fc839656595}} </div>  <div class=\"col-5\"> <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-5\"> Nested col-5: my proportions are ok but I won't align to root column grid </div>  <div class=\"col-2\"> Nested col-2 </div>  <div class=\"col-5\"> Nested col-5 </div>    </div> </div>    </div>        <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-9\"> col-9 </div>  <div class=\"col-3\"> col-3 with constrained 1000px wide player {{i5f20483a2fe9d}} </div>    </div>        <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-7\"> col-7 {{i5f15a99f2fc7b_french}} </div>  <div class=\"col-5\"> col-5 <br> {{img_5f4f84bf770fc839656595}} </div>    </div>        <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-6\"> lone col-6 <br> {{i5f20483a2fcb8}} </div>    </div>        <div class=\"grid-row\">    <div class=\"col-1\"> col-1 (don't use it for content) </div>  <div class=\"col-10\"> col-10 </div>  <div class=\"col-1\"> col-1 (really don't use it!) </div>    </div>",
